spinners.svg: five spinners at 60 frames a second
  lime    at (250, 250): its hand turns 25 degrees a frame, 72 frames a loop
  red     at (125, 125): its hand turns -20 degrees a frame, 18 frames a loop
  yellow  at (375, 125): its hand turns 30 degrees a frame, 12 frames a loop
  white   at (125, 375): its hand turns -35 degrees a frame, 72 frames a loop
  orange  at (375, 375): its hand turns 15 degrees a frame, 24 frames a loop

